---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro";
---

<Base title="MCP Integration — point-grab" description="Connect point-grab to AI coding agents via MCP.">
  <Section padding="md">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">MCP Integration</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-text-muted">
        Connect point-grab to AI coding agents via the Model Context Protocol.
      </p>

      <!-- Table of contents -->
      <nav class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-raised p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-faint mb-3">On this page</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><a href="#what-is-mcp" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline">What is MCP</a></li>
          <li><a href="#how-it-works" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline">How it works</a></li>
          <li><a href="#setup-claude-code" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline">Setup for Claude Code</a></li>
          <li><a href="#setup-cursor" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline">Setup for Cursor</a></li>
          <li><a href="#available-tools" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline">Available tools</a></li>
          <li><a href="#configuration" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline">Configuration</a></li>
          <li><a href="#webhook" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline">Webhook endpoint</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- What is MCP -->
  <Section id="what-is-mcp" padding="md" background="raised">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What is MCP</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted">
        MCP (Model Context Protocol) is a standard for connecting AI agents to external tools and data sources. An MCP server exposes "tools" that agents can call. The <code class="text-amber font-mono">@point-grab/mcp-server</code> exposes tools that let an agent query element captures from your running web app &mdash; you inspect an element in the browser, and your AI agent gets the full context it needs to make changes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <Section id="how-it-works" padding="md">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">How it works</h2>

      <!-- Flow diagram -->
      <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-raised p-6 overflow-x-auto">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 min-w-[600px]">
          <!-- Browser -->
          <div class="flex-1 rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-faint mb-3">Browser</div>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
              <div class="rounded bg-bg-muted px-3 py-1.5 text-text-muted">1. Hold Cmd+C, hover, click</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-bg-muted px-3 py-1.5 text-text-muted">2. Copy snippet to clipboard</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-point-grab-blue/10 border border-point-grab-blue/20 px-3 py-1.5 text-point-grab-blue">3. MCP webhook fires</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Arrow -->
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center pt-12 shrink-0">
            <div class="font-mono text-xs text-text-faint mb-1">HTTP POST</div>
            <div class="text-text-faint">&rarr;</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-xs text-text-faint mt-1">:3456/inspect</div>
          </div>

          <!-- MCP Server -->
          <div class="flex-1 rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-faint mb-3">MCP Server</div>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
              <div class="rounded bg-bg-muted px-3 py-1.5 text-text-muted">4. Validate payload</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-bg-muted px-3 py-1.5 text-text-muted">5. Store in history</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-amber/10 border border-amber/20 px-3 py-1.5 text-amber">6. Serve MCP tools</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Arrow -->
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center pt-12 shrink-0">
            <div class="font-mono text-xs text-text-faint mb-1">stdio</div>
            <div class="text-text-faint">&rarr;</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-xs text-text-faint mt-1">MCP protocol</div>
          </div>

          <!-- AI Agent -->
          <div class="flex-1 rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg p-4">
            <div class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-faint mb-3">AI Agent</div>
            <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
              <div class="rounded bg-bg-muted px-3 py-1.5 text-text-muted">7. Call point_grab_recent</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-bg-muted px-3 py-1.5 text-text-muted">8. Get capture context</div>
              <div class="rounded bg-success/10 border border-success/20 px-3 py-1.5 text-success">9. Edit the right file</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Setup for Claude Code -->
  <Section id="setup-claude-code" padding="md" background="raised">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Setup for Claude Code</h2>

      <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted">Quickest approach &mdash; one command:</p>
      <CodeBlock class="mt-3" code="claude mcp add point-grab -- npx @point-grab/mcp-server" />

      <p class="mt-6 text-text-muted">Or add to your project's <code class="text-amber font-mono">.mcp.json</code>:</p>
      <CodeBlock class="mt-3" lang="json" filename=".mcp.json" code={`{
  "mcpServers": {
    "point-grab": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@point-grab/mcp-server"]
    }
  }
}`} />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Setup for Cursor -->
  <Section id="setup-cursor" padding="md">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Setup for Cursor</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted">Add to <code class="text-amber font-mono">.cursor/mcp.json</code>:</p>
      <CodeBlock class="mt-3" lang="json" filename=".cursor/mcp.json" code={`{
  "mcpServers": {
    "point-grab": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@point-grab/mcp-server"]
    }
  }
}`} />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Available tools -->
  <Section id="available-tools" padding="md" background="raised">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Available tools</h2>

      <!-- point_grab_search -->
      <div id="point_grab_search" class="mt-8">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <code class="font-mono text-amber">point_grab_search</code>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Search capture history by text, component name, file path, or framework.</p>

        <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-border bg-bg-muted">
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Parameter</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Type</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Required</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Description</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">query</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">string</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-faint">no</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Searches HTML, component name, file path, selector, framework</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-border/50 bg-bg-raised/50">
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">componentName</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">string</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-faint">no</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Filter by component name (partial match)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">filePath</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">string</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-faint">no</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Filter by file path (partial match)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-border/50 bg-bg-raised/50">
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">framework</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">string</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-faint">no</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Exact match: "angular", "react", "vue", "svelte", "web-components", "vanilla"</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">limit</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">number</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-faint">no</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Max results (default: 10)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-faint">Example response:</p>
        <CodeBlock class="mt-2" lang="json" code={`{
  "total": 1,
  "results": [
    {
      "id": "1714200000000-abc123",
      "timestamp": "2025-04-27T12:00:00.000Z",
      "snippet": "<div class=\\"user-card\\">\\n  <h3>Jane Doe</h3>\\n</div>\\nin UserCard at src/components/UserCard.tsx:18",
      "context": {
        "componentName": "UserCard",
        "filePath": "src/components/UserCard.tsx",
        "line": 18,
        "column": null,
        "selector": "div.user-card",
        "cssClasses": ["user-card"],
        "html": "<div class=\\"user-card\\">\\n  <h3>Jane Doe</h3>\\n</div>",
        "componentStack": [
          { "name": "UserCard", "filePath": "src/components/UserCard.tsx", "line": 18, "column": null },
          { "name": "Dashboard", "filePath": "src/pages/Dashboard.tsx", "line": 42, "column": null },
          { "name": "App", "filePath": "src/App.tsx", "line": 7, "column": null }
        ],
        "framework": "react",
        "computedStyles": null
      }
    }
  ]
}`} />
      </div>

      <!-- point_grab_recent -->
      <div id="point_grab_recent" class="mt-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <code class="font-mono text-amber">point_grab_recent</code>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Get the N most recent captures.</p>

        <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-border bg-bg-muted">
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Parameter</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Type</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Required</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Description</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">limit</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">number</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-faint">no</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Number of recent captures (default: 5)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-text-faint">Returns the same response shape as <code class="text-amber font-mono">point_grab_search</code>.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- point_grab_get -->
      <div id="point_grab_get" class="mt-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <code class="font-mono text-amber">point_grab_get</code>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Get a specific capture by ID.</p>

        <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-border bg-bg-muted">
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Parameter</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Type</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Required</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Description</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">id</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">string</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold text-text-heading">yes</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">The capture entry ID (e.g., "1714200000000-abc123")</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-text-faint">Returns a single entry object (same shape as entries in <code class="text-amber font-mono">point_grab_search</code> results). Throws if ID not found.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- point_grab_stats -->
      <div id="point_grab_stats" class="mt-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <code class="font-mono text-amber">point_grab_stats</code>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Get summary statistics about capture history. No parameters.</p>

        <CodeBlock class="mt-4" lang="json" code={`{
  "totalGrabs": 47,
  "uniqueComponents": 12,
  "uniqueFiles": 8,
  "maxEntries": 50,
  "frameworks": {
    "react": 38,
    "angular": 9
  },
  "recentActivity": {
    "last24Hours": 15,
    "last7Days": 47
  },
  "mostRecentGrab": "2025-04-27T12:00:00.000Z"
}`} />
      </div>

      <!-- point_grab_frameworks -->
      <div id="point_grab_frameworks" class="mt-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">
          <code class="font-mono text-amber">point_grab_frameworks</code>
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Get capture counts grouped by detected framework. No parameters.</p>

        <CodeBlock class="mt-4" lang="json" code={`{
  "totalGrabs": 47,
  "frameworks": {
    "react": 38,
    "angular": 9
  }
}`} />
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Configuration -->
  <Section id="configuration" padding="md">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Configuration</h2>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6">Environment variables</h3>

      <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-border bg-bg-raised">
              <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Variable</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Default</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Description</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">POINT_GRAB_PORT</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">3456</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">HTTP port for the webhook listener</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">POINT_GRAB_HISTORY_PATH</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-text-faint">~/.point-grab/history.json</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">File path for persistent history storage</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-text-muted">Custom configuration in MCP settings:</p>
      <CodeBlock class="mt-3" lang="json" filename=".mcp.json" code={`{
  "mcpServers": {
    "point-grab": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@point-grab/mcp-server"],
      "env": {
        "POINT_GRAB_PORT": "4000",
        "POINT_GRAB_HISTORY_PATH": "/Users/you/.point-grab/history.json"
      }
    }
  }
}`} />
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Webhook endpoint -->
  <Section id="webhook" padding="md" background="raised">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Webhook endpoint</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-text-muted">
        The MCP server listens for incoming captures on two paths (for backward compatibility):
      </p>

      <CodeBlock class="mt-4" lang="text" code={`POST http://localhost:3456/inspect
POST http://localhost:3456/grab
Content-Type: application/json`} />

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8">Request body</h3>
      <CodeBlock class="mt-3" lang="json" code={`{
  "html": "<div>...</div>",           // required
  "componentName": "UserCard",        // required
  "filePath": "src/UserCard.tsx",     // optional
  "line": 18,                         // optional
  "column": null,                     // optional
  "componentStack": [...],            // optional
  "selector": "div.user-card",        // optional
  "cssClasses": ["user-card"],        // optional
  "framework": "react",               // optional
  "snippet": "...",                    // optional
  "computedStyles": {}                 // optional
}`} />

      <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8">Responses</h3>
      <div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-border bg-bg-muted">
              <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Status</th>
              <th class="px-4 py-2.5 text-left font-semibold text-text-heading">Meaning</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-success">200 OK</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Capture stored successfully</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50 bg-bg-raised/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">400 Bad Request</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Missing required fields (<code class="font-mono text-text-faint">html</code>, <code class="font-mono text-text-faint">componentName</code>)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-border/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-amber">413 Payload Too Large</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Body exceeds 512 KB</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 font-mono text-error">500 Internal Server Error</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-text-muted">Server error</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-text-faint">
        The browser-side webhook plugin (auto-registered when <code class="text-amber font-mono">mcpWebhook: true</code>) handles all of this automatically. The webhook is fire-and-forget &mdash; it silently ignores errors if the MCP server isn't running. CORS headers (<code class="text-text-faint font-mono">Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *</code>) are included so the browser can POST from any origin.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <!-- Page nav -->
  <Section padding="sm">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl flex items-center justify-between border-t border-border pt-8">
      <a href="/docs/features" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline text-sm font-medium">&larr; Features</a>
      <a href="/docs/api" class="text-point-grab-blue hover:underline text-sm font-medium">API Reference &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Base>
